Text: Constitución de la República de Cuba, proclaimed 10 April 2019, from Gaceta Oficial de la República de Cuba No. 5 Extraordinaria (https://www.gacetaoficial.gob.cu/sites/default/files/goc-2019-ex5.pdf), Ministerio de Justicia; Código Penal (Ley No. 151/2022), Gaceta Oficial No. 93 Ordinaria, 1 September 2022 (https://www.gacetaoficial.gob.cu/sites/default/files/goc-2022-o93_0.pdf); Código Civil (Ley No. 59/1987), updated edition of 8 November 2022 (https://www.gacetaoficial.gob.cu/sites/default/files/codigo_civil_actualizado_0.pdf). The site states no licence; the official legal text is reproduced for reference with attribution to the publisher.

